    "id": "37abbc94",
    "name": "Fleet Target Sweep (5 Drones) 1",
    "content": "Five-drone target sweep: Yard 15, Yard 29, Yard 11, Yard 21, and Yard 12 take off together to 23 meters altitude. Yard 15 flies to target Bay 069, Yard 29 flies to target Bay 077, Yard 11 flies to target Bay 031, Yard 21 flies to target Bay 082, and Yard 12 flies to target Bay 097. After reaching the targets, all five drones move west for 62m, then south for 102m, then north for 97m together. Each drone must complete the specified directional movements (west 62m, south 102m, north 97m) regardless of starting position - if obstacles block the path, drones should adjust position as needed to complete the full directed distance in each heading.",
    "content_aliases": [
      "Coordinate Yard 15, Yard 29, Yard 11, Yard 21, and Yard 12: ascend together to 23 meters altitude, send Yard 15 to target Bay 069, Yard 29 to target Bay 077, Yard 11 to target Bay 031, Yard 21 to target Bay 082, and Yard 12 to target Bay 097, then execute coordinated sweep movement west 62m, south 102m, and north 97m. All drones must complete the full directional distance (west 62m, south 102m, north 97m) from their respective positions, adjusting as needed to avoid obstacles.",
      "Five-drone target sweep operation: launch Yard 15, Yard 29, Yard 11, Yard 21, and Yard 12 to altitude 23m, navigate to targets Bay 069, Bay 077, Bay 031, Bay 082, Bay 097 respectively, then shift west by 62 meters, south by 102 meters, and north by 97 meters in synchronized operation. Each drone travels the specified distance in each direction regardless of obstacles encountered.",
      "Execute five-drone sweep mission: Yard 15, Yard 29, Yard 11, Yard 21, Yard 12 take off reaching 23 meters height, fly to targets Bay 069, Bay 077, Bay 031, Bay 082, Bay 097 respectively, then proceed west for 62m, subsequently south for 102m, and finally north for 97m together, with each drone completing the full directed movements by repositioning around obstacles if necessary.",
      "Five-drone coordinated target mission: Yard 15, Yard 29, Yard 11, Yard 21, and Yard 12 lift off to 23m elevation, reach targets Bay 069, Bay 077, Bay 031, Bay 082, Bay 097 respectively, then travel west 62 meters, south 102 meters, and north 97 meters in sequence. The specified directional distances must be achieved by each drone, adapting position to circumvent any obstacles."
    ],
