    "content": "Five-drone target sweep: Yard 15, Yard 29, Yard 11, Yard 21, and Yard 12 take off together to 23 meters altitude. Yard 15 flies to target Bay 069, Yard 29 flies to target Bay 077, Yard 11 flies to target Bay 031, Yard 21 flies to target Bay 082, and Yard 12 flies to target Bay 097. After reaching the targets, all five drones move west for 62m, then south for 102m, then north for 97m together. Each drone must complete the specified directional movements (west 62m, south 102m, north 97m) regardless of starting position - if obstacles block the path, drones should adjust position as needed to complete the full directed distance in each heading.",
